      "question": "মান নির্ণয় করি :\n(i) $(\\sqrt[5]{8})^{\\frac{5}{2}} \\times (16)^{-\\frac{3}{2}}$\n(ii) $\\{(125)^{-2} \\times (16)^{-\\frac{3}{2}}\\}^{-\\frac{1}{6}}$\n(iii) $4^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\times \\left[2^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\times 3^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right] \\div 9^{\\frac{1}{4}}$",
      "solution": [
        "**(i)**",
        "$= (8^{\\frac{1}{5}})^{\\frac{5}{2}} \\times (2^4)^{-\\frac{3}{2}}$",
        "$= 8^{\\frac{1}{5} \\times \\frac{5}{2}} \\times 2^{4 \\times -\\frac{3}{2}}$",
        "$= 8^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\times 2^{-6}$",
        "$= (2^3)^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\times 2^{-6}$",
        "$= 2^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\times 2^{-6}$",
