      "question": "প্রমাণ করি :\n(i) $\\left(\\frac{a^q}{a^r}\\right)^p \\times \\left(\\frac{a^r}{a^p}\\right)^q \\times \\left(\\frac{a^p}{a^q}\\right)^r = 1$\n(ii) $\\left(\\frac{x^m}{x^n}\\right)^{m+n} \\times \\left(\\frac{x^n}{x^l}\\right)^{n+l} \\times \\left(\\frac{x^l}{x^m}\\right)^{l+m} = 1$\n(iii) $\\left(\\frac{x^m}{x^n}\\right)^{m+n-l} \\times \\left(\\frac{x^n}{x^l}\\right)^{n+l-m} \\times \\left(\\frac{x^l}{x^m}\\right)^{l+m-n} = 1$\n(iv) $\\left(a^{\\frac{1}{x-y}}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{x-z}} \\times \\left(a^{\\frac{1}{y-z}}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{y-x}} \\times \\left(a^{\\frac{1}{z-x}}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{z-y}} = 1$",
      "solution": [
        "**(i)**",
        "$\\text{LHS} = (a^{q-r})^p \\times (a^{r-p})^q \\times (a^{p-q})^r$",
        "$= a^{pq - pr} \\times a^{rq - pq} \\times a^{pr - qr}$",
        "$= a^{(pq - pr) + (rq - pq) + (pr - qr)}$",
        "$= a^0$",
        "$= 1 = \\text{RHS}$ (প্রমাণিত)",
        "**(ii)**",
        "$\\text{LHS} = (x^{m-n})^{m+n} \\times (x^{n-l})^{n+l} \\times (x^{l-m})^{l+m}$",
        "$(a-b)(a+b) = a^2 - b^2$ সূত্র প্রয়োগ করে পাই:",
        "$= x^{m^2 - n^2} \\times x^{n^2 - l^2} \\times x^{l^2 - m^2}$",
        "$= x^{(m^2 - n^2) + (n^2 - l^2) + (l^2 - m^2)}$",
        "$= x^0$",
        "$= 1 = \\text{RHS}$ (প্রমাণিত)",
        "**(iii)**",
        "$\\text{LHS} = (x^{m-n})^{m+n-l} \\times (x^{n-l})^{n+l-m} \\times (x^{l-m})^{l+m-n}$",
        "$= x^{(m-n)(m+n-l)} \\times x^{(n-l)(n+l-m)} \\times x^{(l-m)(l+m-n)}$",
        "পাওয়ারগুলিকে গুণ করে যোগ করি:",
        "১ম পদ: $(m-n)(m+n-l) = m^2 + mn - ml - mn - n^2 + nl = m^2 - n^2 - ml + nl$",
        "২য় পদ: $(n-l)(n+l-m) = n^2 + nl - nm - ln - l^2 + lm = n^2 - l^2 - nm + lm$",
        "৩য় পদ: $(l-m)(l+m-n) = l^2 + lm - ln - ml - m^2 + mn = l^2 - m^2 - ln + mn$",
        "সব পাওয়ারের যোগফল: $(m^2 - n^2 - ml + nl) + (n^2 - l^2 - nm + lm) + (l^2 - m^2 - ln + mn) = 0$",
        "$= x^0$",
        "$= 1 = \\text{RHS}$ (প্রমাণিত)",
        "**(iv)**",
        "$\\text{LHS} = a^{\\frac{1}{(x-y)(x-z)}} \\times a^{\\frac{1}{(y-z)(y-x)}} \\times a^{\\frac{1}{(z-x)(z-y)}}$",
        "হরের রাশিগুলিকে চক্রাকারে (cyclic order) সাজিয়ে পাই:",
        "$= a^{\\frac{-1}{(x-y)(z-x)}} \\times a^{\\frac{-1}{(y-z)(x-y)}} \\times a^{\\frac{-1}{(z-x)(y-z)}}$",
        "$= a^{- \\left[ \\frac{1}{(x-y)(z-x)} + \\frac{1}{(y-z)(x-y)} + \\frac{1}{(z-x)(y-z)} \\right]}$",
        "ল.সা.গু. হলো $(x-y)(y-z)(z-x)$",
